<main id="main-content"><div class="page-intro page-intro--visual"><div class="page-intro-layout site-container"><div class="page-intro-copy"><p class="brand-eyebrow">DELIVERY &amp; RETURNS</p><h1>Plan the details<br>before your purchase.</h1><p>Delivery requirements and product-specific arrangements are confirmed as part of your quotation.</p></div><?php require APP_ROOT . "/includes/page-intro-visual.php"; ?></div></div><section class="section-space"><div class="site-container policy-copy"><h2>Delivery arrangements</h2><p>Tell our team your delivery address, required date, quantity and handling requirements when submitting a request. The available method, delivery charge and expected timeframe are confirmed before the purchase is agreed.</p><h2>Perishable and bulk products</h2><p>Fresh products, feed bags, packaging and equipment can require different handling arrangements. Ask for the packaging, transport and storage information applicable to the specific product. The website does not calculate a guaranteed delivery schedule.</p><h2>International requirements</h2><p>Use the <a href="export.php">export inquiry form</a> to provide the destination country, port, quantity and documentation requirements. Freight, product availability and supply terms are discussed individually.</p><h2>Inspecting a delivery</h2><p>Check the quantity, packaging and condition when receiving goods. If you notice damage, a shortage or a product concern, keep the order reference and relevant photographs, then contact our team promptly so the issue can be reviewed.</p><h2>Returns and replacements</h2><p>Applicable return, replacement and warranty arrangements depend on the product and the confirmed supply agreement. Contact our team before sending goods back.</p><p><a href="contact.php">Contact our team about delivery or an existing request</a>.</p></div></section></main>